{"id":3301,"slug":"3301-serialization-va-response-transformation-voi-class-transformer-trong-nestjs","category":"NestJS","subcategory":"Request Pipeline","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Serialization và response transformation với class-transformer trong NestJS?","question_en":"Serialization and response transformation with class-transformer in NestJS?","answer_vi":"**class-transformer** cùng với `ClassSerializerInterceptor` tự động serialize/exclude fields trong response.\n\n**Exclude sensitive fields** (password, tokens):\n```typescript\nimport { Exclude, Expose, Transform } from 'class-transformer';\n\nexport class UserEntity {\n  id: number;\n  email: string;\n\n  @Exclude()  // Không expose trong response\n  password: string;\n\n  @Expose()\n  @Transform(({ value }) => value?.toISOString())\n  createdAt: Date;\n\n  constructor(partial: Partial<UserEntity>) {\n    Object.assign(this, partial);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Enable globally**:\n```typescript\napp.useGlobalInterceptors(new ClassSerializerInterceptor(app.get(Reflector)));\n```\n\n**Controller return entity**:\n```typescript\n@Get(':id')\nasync findOne(@Param('id') id: number): Promise<UserEntity> {\n  const user = await this.usersService.findOne(id);\n  return new UserEntity(user);  // Wrap trong entity class\n}\n```\n\nLưu ý: plain objects không bị transform — phải trả về instance của entity class để decorator có effect.","answer_en":"**class-transformer** together with `ClassSerializerInterceptor` serializes and excludes response fields automatically.\n\n**Exclude sensitive fields** (password, tokens):\n```typescript\nimport { Exclude, Expose, Transform } from 'class-transformer';\n\nexport class UserEntity {\n  id: number;\n  email: string;\n\n  @Exclude()  // never exposed in the response\n  password: string;\n\n  @Expose()\n  @Transform(({ value }) => value?.toISOString())\n  createdAt: Date;\n\n  constructor(partial: Partial<UserEntity>) {\n    Object.assign(this, partial);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Enable globally**:\n```typescript\napp.useGlobalInterceptors(new ClassSerializerInterceptor(app.get(Reflector)));\n```\n\n**Return the entity from the controller**:\n```typescript\n@Get(':id')\nasync findOne(@Param('id') id: number): Promise<UserEntity> {\n  const user = await this.usersService.findOne(id);\n  return new UserEntity(user);  // wrap in the entity class\n}\n```\n\nNote: plain objects are not transformed — you must return an instance of the entity class for the decorators to take effect","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>class-transformer</strong> cùng với <code>ClassSerializerInterceptor</code> tự động serialize/exclude fields trong response.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Exclude sensitive fields</strong> (password, tokens):</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"import { Exclude, Expose, Transform } from 'class-transformer';\n\nexport class UserEntity {\n  id: number;\n  email: string;\n\n  @Exclude()  // Không expose trong response\n  password: string;\n\n  @Expose()\n  @Transform(({ value }) =&gt; value?.toISOString())\n  createdAt: Date;\n\n  constructor(partial: Partial&lt;UserEntity&gt;) {\n    Object.assign(this, partial);\n  }\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Exclude</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Expose</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Transform</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;class-transformer&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserEntity</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">email</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>;\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Exclude</span>()  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Không expose trong response</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">password</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>;\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Expose</span>()\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Transform</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">{ value }</span>) =&gt;</span> value?.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toISOString</span>())\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">createdAt</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Date</span>;\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">constructor</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">partial</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Partial</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserEntity</span>&gt;</span>) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">assign</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>, partial);\n  }\n}</code></pre></div><p><strong>Enable globally</strong>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"app.useGlobalInterceptors(new ClassSerializerInterceptor(app.get(Reflector)));\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useGlobalInterceptors</span>(<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ClassSerializerInterceptor</span>(app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Reflector</span>)));</code></pre></div><p><strong>Controller return entity</strong>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"@Get(':id')\nasync findOne(@Param('id') id: number): Promise&lt;UserEntity&gt; {\n  const user = await this.usersService.findOne(id);\n  return new UserEntity(user);  // Wrap trong entity class\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;:id&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">findOne</span>(<span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Param</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;id&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>): <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserEntity</span>&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> user = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">usersService</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">findOne</span>(id);\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserEntity</span>(user);  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Wrap trong entity class</span>\n}</code></pre></div><p>Lưu ý: plain objects không bị transform — phải trả về instance của entity class để decorator có effect.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>class-transformer</strong> together with <code>ClassSerializerInterceptor</code> serializes and excludes response fields automatically.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Exclude sensitive fields</strong> (password, tokens):</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"import { Exclude, Expose, Transform } from 'class-transformer';\n\nexport class UserEntity {\n  id: number;\n  email: string;\n\n  @Exclude()  // never exposed in the response\n  password: string;\n\n  @Expose()\n  @Transform(({ value }) =&gt; value?.toISOString())\n  createdAt: Date;\n\n  constructor(partial: Partial&lt;UserEntity&gt;) {\n    Object.assign(this, partial);\n  }\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Exclude</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Expose</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Transform</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;class-transformer&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserEntity</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">email</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>;\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Exclude</span>()  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// never exposed in the response</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">password</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>;\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Expose</span>()\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Transform</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">{ value }</span>) =&gt;</span> value?.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toISOString</span>())\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">createdAt</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Date</span>;\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">constructor</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">partial</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Partial</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserEntity</span>&gt;</span>) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">assign</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>, partial);\n  }\n}</code></pre></div><p><strong>Enable globally</strong>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"app.useGlobalInterceptors(new ClassSerializerInterceptor(app.get(Reflector)));\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useGlobalInterceptors</span>(<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ClassSerializerInterceptor</span>(app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Reflector</span>)));</code></pre></div><p><strong>Return the entity from the controller</strong>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"@Get(':id')\nasync findOne(@Param('id') id: number): Promise&lt;UserEntity&gt; {\n  const user = await this.usersService.findOne(id);\n  return new UserEntity(user);  // wrap in the entity class\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;:id&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">findOne</span>(<span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Param</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;id&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>): <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserEntity</span>&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> user = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">usersService</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">findOne</span>(id);\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserEntity</span>(user);  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// wrap in the entity class</span>\n}</code></pre></div><p>Note: plain objects are not transformed — you must return an instance of the entity class for the decorators to take effect.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3264-giai-thich-request-lifecycle-trong-nestjs-middleware-guards-interceptors-pipes-c","title":"Giải thích Request Lifecycle trong NestJS: Middleware → Guards → Interceptors → Pipes → Controller → Exception Filters."},{"url":"/q/3265-guards-trong-nestjs-la-gi-cach-implement-jwt-auth-guard","title":"Guards trong NestJS là gì? Cách implement JWT Auth Guard?"},{"url":"/q/3266-pipes-trong-nestjs-la-gi-cach-dung-validationpipe-voi-class-validator","title":"Pipes trong NestJS là gì? Cách dùng ValidationPipe với class-validator?"},{"url":"/q/3267-interceptors-trong-nestjs-hoat-dong-nhu-the-nao-neu-cac-use-case-pho-bien","title":"Interceptors trong NestJS hoạt động như thế nào? Nêu các use-case phổ biến."},{"url":"/q/3268-exception-filters-trong-nestjs-la-gi-cach-tao-global-error-handler","title":"Exception Filters trong NestJS là gì? Cách tạo global error handler."},{"url":"/q/3276-custom-decorators-trong-nestjs-cach-tao-currentuser-roles-public","title":"Custom Decorators trong NestJS — cách tạo @CurrentUser, @Roles, @Public?"},{"url":"/q/3279-middleware-trong-nestjs-functional-vs-class-middleware-apply-theo-routes","title":"Middleware trong NestJS — functional vs class middleware, apply theo routes?"},{"url":"/q/3260-nestjs-la-gi-tai-sao-nen-dung-nestjs-thay-vi-express-thuan","title":"NestJS là gì? Tại sao nên dùng NestJS thay vì Express thuần?"}]}